#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: brikpanel.php
msgid "BrikPanel: WooCommerce Admin Dashboard Theme"
msgstr "BrikPanel: motyw panelu administracyjnego WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: brikpanel.php
msgid ""
"Beautiful and modern Shopify-style WooCommerce admin panel & dashboard, "
"fully free, forever."
msgstr ""
"Piękny i nowoczesny panel administracyjny oraz pulpit WooCommerce w stylu "
"Shopify, w pełni darmowy na zawsze."

#. Author of the plugin
#: brikpanel.php
msgid "Brksoft"
msgstr "Brksoft"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: brikpanel.php
msgid "https://brksoft.com/"
msgstr "https://brksoft.com/"

#: brikpanel.php:87
msgid "BrikPanel could not load all of its files."
msgstr ""

#: brikpanel.php:89
msgid ""
"Some plugin files are missing, most likely from an interrupted update or a "
"security scan. BrikPanel is running in a limited mode. Please reinstall the "
"plugin (deactivate, delete, then install the latest version again) to "
"restore full functionality. Your settings and data are kept."
msgstr ""

#: brikpanel.php:133
msgid ""
"WooCommerce is not active on this site, so BrikPanel features are disabled "
"here. Activate WooCommerce to enable BrikPanel."
msgstr ""
"WooCommerce nie jest aktywne na tej witrynie, więc funkcje BrikPanel są "
"tutaj wyłączone. Aktywuj WooCommerce, aby włączyć BrikPanel."

#. translators: %d: number of hidden third-party admin notices
#: brikpanel.php:555
#, php-format
msgid "%d hidden notice"
msgid_plural "%d hidden notices"
msgstr[0] "%d ukryte powiadomienie"
msgstr[1] "%d ukryte powiadomienia"
msgstr[2] "%d ukrytych powiadomień"

#: brikpanel.php:558
msgid ""
"Other plugins and themes posted these notices. BrikPanel keeps them hidden, "
"click to show."
msgstr ""
"Te powiadomienia pochodzą z innych wtyczek i motywów. BrikPanel je ukrywa, "
"kliknij, aby wyświetlić."

